  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup boiling water",
    "1 (6 ounce) package lime flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "1 (20 ounce) can crushed pineapple, drained with juice reserved",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "2 cups heavy cream",
    "1 cup chopped pecans"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/G7V0l-4resgbuTdXspLhvccDf2E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13595-lime-gelatin-salad-DDMFS-94-step1-a994f71cac044233b3b480fc3aae89ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13595/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine boiling water and gelatin mix in a large bowl; stir until dissolved. Stir in 1/2 cup pineapple juice. Refrigerate until thickened but not set, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o98utF-EXfKTcR1inmYmx17EveQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13595-lime-gelatin-salad-DDMFS-95-step2-ae6958524f414f508c763d8c9a82015d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13595/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, place crushed pineapple and remaining juice in a small saucepan. Bring to a boil, reduce heat, and simmer for about 5 minutes. Remove from heat, and cool to room temperature. Blend softened cream cheese and prepared gelatin until smooth. Mix in cooled pineapple.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C-dYcPvL0e9Y98Y3wmSO0Y0B4x0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13595-lime-gelatin-salad-57-step6-7ce38902397b4e8b9c282b669740b5c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13595/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat heavy cream in a chilled glass or metal bowl with an electric mixer until soft peaks form.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RRfdiWUnsflH3ovVos5P3HV5zv0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13595-lime-gelatin-salad-58-step7-c23b402dad464bbc9d525caa42dc6363.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13595/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold whipped cream into gelatin mixture. Fold in chopped nuts. Pour into a pretty glass bowl, and refrigerate for at least 4 hours or until set.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZGfsNM5VvgCDF7I-m3inGXdw9XU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13595-lime-gelatin-salad-60-step9-4607f49b87f14a1ebbac2155f1ff233c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13595/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
